== GET /todo/all ==
<section class="todo"><div class="card"><h3>all — 3 open of 4</h3><ul><li class="done">buy beans</li><li class="open">grind beans</li><li class="open">boil water</li><li class="open">pour</li></ul></div></section>
components mounted: 6 — the page, the card and 4 items

== clicking the third item ==
the click found its handler: true
renders this pass: 3 of 6 mounted components
<section class="todo"><div class="card"><h3>all — 2 open of 4</h3><ul><li class="done">buy beans</li><li class="open">grind beans</li><li class="done">boil water</li><li class="open">pour</li></ul></div></section>

== clicking it again puts it back ==
renders this pass: 3
<section class="todo"><div class="card"><h3>all — 3 open of 4</h3><ul><li class="done">buy beans</li><li class="open">grind beans</li><li class="open">boil water</li><li class="open">pour</li></ul></div></section>

== dropping a task, from outside any event ==
renders this pass: 2
items still mounted: 3
<section class="todo"><div class="card"><h3>all — 2 open of 3</h3><ul><li class="done">buy beans</li><li class="open">boil water</li><li class="open">pour</li></ul></div></section>

== GET /todo/open — the same page, a different parameter ==
<section class="todo"><div class="card"><h3>open — 3 open of 4</h3><ul><li class="open">grind beans</li><li class="open">boil water</li><li class="open">pour</li></ul></div></section>

== GET /todo/done ==
<section class="todo"><div class="card"><h3>done — 3 open of 4</h3><ul><li class="done">buy beans</li></ul></div></section>

== GET /todo — no {filter} in the path ==
no page is routed there — the host answers 404
